\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Can the discrepancy between the lattice dimensions in the quantum and classical reductions from GapSVP to learning with errors be removed or explained, namely dimension n for the quantum reduction versus order square-root-n for the classical reduction? \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2014/51}{[S2]}
